Package: curveRweights
Title: Bayesian Precision Weighting from Calibration Curve Uncertainty
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Immunoplex", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "maintainer@immunoplex.org")
Description: Part of the curveR ecosystem. Consumes the calibration_result and
    calibration_result_multiplate S3 objects produced by curveRfreq and
    curveRbayes and estimates the power-law relationship between
    calibration-curve precision (the uncapped se_concentration) and residual
    variance via a joint Bayesian location-scale model, yielding per-observation
    precision weights that retain information from observations a binary
    quantification gate would discard.
